<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 344.25 mln rand S.Africa bonds Mon.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 344.25 mln rand S.Africa bonds Mon.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 344.25 million rand's worth of bonds on Monday after buying 1,016.37 million rand's worth on Friday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
